      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "North Conway hosts the Green Hills Preserve, a low north–south ridge that includes Rattlesnake, Middle, Peaked, and Black Cap mountains.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
